l":"https://mfn.se/ind/a/nexcom/financial-report-q1-q3-2026-january-1st-september-30th-2026-19add91e","tags":["report","report:interim"]},{"date":"2026-10-26T15:07","title":"Nexcom Appoints Finance Director","url":"https://mfn.se/ind/a/nexcom/nexcom-appoints-finance-director-5dae8b30","tags":[]},{"date":"2026-10-20T12:41","title":"Nexcom Appoints Chief Sales Officer","url":"https://mfn.se/ind/a/nexcom/nexcom-appoints-chief-sales-officer-adb662be","tags":[]},{"date":"2026-09-29T15:18","title":"Strategic Investments A/S ejer nu 57,28 % af Nexcom A/S","url":"https://mfn.se/ind/a/nexcom/strategic-investments-a-s-ejer-nu-57-28-af-nexcom-a-s-256e7843","tags":[]},{"date":"2026-09-23T10:17","title":"Korrektion - Første handelsdag for nye aktier","url":"https://mfn.se/ind/a/nexcom/korrektion-forste-handelsdag-for-nye-aktier-6b0a783b","tags":[]},{"date":"2026-09-22T20:36","title":"Første handelsdag for nye aktier","url":"https://mfn.se/ind/a/nexcom/forste-handelsdag-for-nye-aktier-5cb81aba","tags":[]},{"date":"2026-09-21T14:13","title":"Ledende Medarbejders Transaktion","url":"https://mfn.se/ind/a/nexcom/ledende-medarbejders-transaktion-7a0242b7","tags":["ci","ci:insider"]},{"date":"2026-09-21T14:10","title":"Ledende Medarbejders Transaktion","url":"https://mfn.se/ind/a/nexcom/ledende-medarbejders-transaktion-70161578","tags":["ci","ci:insider"]},{"date":"2026-09-10T17:00","title":"Ledende Medarbejders Transaktion","url":"https://mfn.se/ind/a/nexcom/ledende-medarbejders-transaktion-d1af3744","tags":["ci","ci:insider"]},{"date":"2026-09-10T11:00","title":"Nexcom A/S offentliggør finanskalender for 2027","url":"https://mfn.se/ind/a/nexcom/nexcom-a-s-offentliggor-finanskalender-for-2027-8b9ad7be","tags":[]},{"date":"2026-09-09T06:27","title":"Nexcom nedbringer sin gæld yderligere","url":"https://mfn.se/ind/a/nexcom/nexcom-nedbringer-sin-gaeld-yderligere-6b4eca49","tags":[]},{"date":"2026-09-01T08:44","title":"Nexcom indgår aftale med TDC NET om koncernlicens til avanceret workflow-automatiseringsplatform","url":"https://mfn.se/ind/a/nexcom/nexcom-indgar-aftale-med-tdc-net-om-koncernlicens-til-avanceret-workflow-automatiseringsplatform-e4cc7071","tags":[]},{"date":"2026-08-12T15:13","title":"FINANCIAL REPORT H1 2026 [January 1st - June 30th, 2026]","url":"https://mfn.se/ind/a/nexcom/financial-report-h1-2026-january-1st-june-30th-2026-a7f68a59","tags":["report","report:interim"]}],"events":[{"date":"2026-10-27","title":"FINANCIAL REPORT Q1-Q3 2026 [January 1st - September 30th, 2026]","text":"The report has not been audited. Financial Report Q3 2026 - Revenue Growth of 47% – Year-to-Date Performance HIGHLIGHTS * Revenue increase of 47%, Q1-Q3 2026 increased revenues to DKK 9,100k, compared with DKK 6,195k in the same period last year. * EBITDA improved by 61%, EBITDA improved from DKK -7,079k in Q1-Q3 2025, to DKK -2,779k. * The cost base decreased by DKK 1,394k, with staff costs down 11% to DKK 6,996k and other external costs down 10% to DKK 4,884k compared with Q1–Q3 2025. * On September 1, 2026, Nexcom announced a DKK 4.8 million agreement granting TDC NET a group-wide license for the use of Nexcom’s advanced workflow automation platform. The agreement includes annual support and maintenance of DKK 0.5 million, expected to contribute to revenue and ARR from 2027. * Nexcom returned to positive equity of DKK 5,136k as of September 30, 2026, following the conversion of DKK 13.6 million of debt owed to Strategic Investments A/S into equity through the issuance of 8.2 million new shares in September. * Nexcom generated positive operating cash flow of DKK 2,825k in Q1–Q3 2026, an improvement of DKK 8,598k compared with DKK -5,773k in the same period last year. Cash and cash equivalents totaled DKK 2,132k at September 30, 2026. * Nexcom improved its net result by DKK 9,416k in Q1–Q3 2026, reducing the net loss by 69% to DKK -4,258k from DKK -13,674k in the same period last year. The improvement also reflected net financial income of DKK 575k, compared with net financial expenses of DKK 4,295k in Q1–Q3 2025. MANAGEMENT REMARKS The strategy remains to secure profitable growth and at the same time maintain a conservative cost level with the aim of getting closer to a cashflow positive situation earliest possible and preferably during 2026. The management believes the current cost level of the operation will result in achieving the announced financial outlook for the year 2026. As previously announced, revenue guidance is set at DKK 10–12 million, with expected EBITDA in the range of DKK -4 million to DKK -2 million. Disclaimer This report contains forward-looking statements based on management's current expectations. All statements about the future are subject to inherent risks and uncertainties, and many factors can lead to actual results and developments that differ materially from those expressed or implied in such statements. FURTHER INFORMATION Rolf Adamson, CEO Phone: + 45 4576 4820 Email: press@nexcomglobal.com COMPANY Nexcom A/S Ewaldsgade 9, st 2200 København N Tlf. + 45 4576 4820 www.nexcomglobal.com CERTIFIED ADVISOR Kapital Partner A/S Christian IX's Gade 10 1111 København K Tlf. + 45 8988 7846 www.kapitalpartner.dk INCOME STATEMENT Q1-Q3 2026 [January 1^{st }- September 30^{th}, 2026] The report has not been audited. ──────────────────────┬──────────┬────────── TDKK │Q1-Q3 2026│Q1-Q3 2025 ──────────────────────┼──────────┼────────── Revenue │9,100 │6,195 ──────────────────────┼──────────┼────────── TOTAL REVENUE │9,100 │6,195 ──────────────────────┼──────────┼────────── Personnel │-6,996 │-7,820 ──────────────────────┼──────────┼────────── Other external costs │-4,884 │-5,454 ──────────────────────┼──────────┼────────── EBITDA │-2,779 │-7,079 ──────────────────────┼──────────┼────────── Depreciation │-2,043 │-2,285 ──────────────────────┼──────────┼────────── EBIT │-4,822 │-9,364 ──────────────────────┼──────────┼────────── Financial expenses │-575 │4,295 ──────────────────────┼──────────┼────────── PROFIT/LOSS BEFORE TAX│-4,247 │-13,659 ──────────────────────┼──────────┼────────── Tax │10 │15 ──────────────────────┼──────────┼────────── PROFIT/LOSS AFTER TAX │-4,258 │-13,674 ──────────────────────┴──────────┴────────── ────────────────────────┬────────── Number of employees │10 ────────────────────────┼────────── Outstanding shares │33,168,329 ────────────────────────┼────────── Earnings per share (DKK)│-0.13 ────────────────────────┴────────── CASHFLOW STATEMENT Q1-Q3 2026 [January 1^{st }- September 30^{th"}],"insider":[],"short":{"date":"2026-10-27","positions":[]},"owners":[],"targets":[],"adviser":{"decisions":[{"date":"2026-10-27","action":"PASS","weight":0.0,"model_action":"PASS","model_weight":0.0,"thesis":"Nexcom är liten och mycket volatil.","falsifier":"Ej relevant.","reason":"Ingen position.","uncertainty":"HIGH","forecasts":{"20":{"expected_excess_return":0.0,"p_loss20":0.14,"p_outperform":0.44},"252":{"expected_excess_return":0.0,"p_loss20":0.65,"p_outperform":0.4},"60":{"expected_excess_return":0.0,"p_loss20":0.33,"p_outperform":0.43}},"outcomes":{}}],"thesis":null}}